---

Upstream Traceability

The decision-generation capability shall maintain traceability to the contextual information from which decisions are generated.

Current operational lineage:

SO-F-002
Observations
      ↓
SO-F-003
Operating Context
      ↓
SO-F-004
Generated Decision

Where appropriate, decision-related engineering artifacts should therefore be capable of tracing a generated decision back through its contextual basis and ultimately to relevant observations.

---

Future Derived Objectives

Future decision-generation objectives shall maintain direct traceability to SO-F-004.

Potential areas include:

- Alternative Response Evaluation
- Adaptive Decision Selection
- Decision Constraint Evaluation
- Decision Confidence
- Decision Representation

These remain architectural candidates and are not approved objectives.

